1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:02,210
(Sheldon:)he'll kill himself.

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,650
(Raj:)Sheldon, listen to me.

3
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:08,250
(Raj:)I have a big decision to make,
and I'm scared.

4
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:11,220
(Sheldon:)Yellow. Go ahead.

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,670
(Raj:)A friend at the School
of Pharmacology

6
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:14,390
(Raj:)gave me these new pills
they're testing.

7
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:15,760
(Raj:)He says it's
the next big thing

8
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:17,160
(Raj:)for social anxiety disorder.

9
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:19,530
(Sheldon:)Fascinating.
What's in it?

10
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:20,960
(Raj:)I'm not sure.

11
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,260
(Raj:)Some sort of beta-blocker
attached to a molecule

12
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:26,270
(Raj:)extracted from
the urine of cows.

13
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:28,400
(Sheldon:)I like cows.

14
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:29,600
(Raj:)That's not the point.

15
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,270
(Sheldon:)It was its own
point. Go on.

16
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:33,910
(Raj:)I'm a scientist.

17
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:36,240
(Raj:)My ability to think
is my bread and butter.

18
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,080
(Raj:)I'm afraid if I take this,
I might lose

19
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:41,980
(Raj:)that special, unique something that
makes me so successful in my field.

20
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:45,490
(Sheldon:)Rajesh, I've had
the privilege

21
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:48,490
(Sheldon:)of working alongside
you for many years.

22
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:52,690
(Sheldon:)My recommendation is that you
gobble these up like Tic Tacs.

23
00:00:58,430 --> 00:01:01,540
(Howard:)Okay, I'm still trying
to work this out.

